  GlassPanel              → TSGlassPanel (Sources/Components/UI/Cards.swift) via VehicleDetailGlassPanel.
  SectionErrorBoundary    → VehicleDetailSectionBoundary / VehicleDetailHeaderBoundary (verbatim fallbackTitle).
  Skeleton/PageHeader…    → TSSkeleton / TSPageHeaderSkeleton / TSStatGridSkeleton / TSChartBlockSkeleton.
  LiveStaleDataBanner     → VehicleDetailLiveBanner; LiveIndicator(compact) → VehicleDetailFreshnessChip (ADR-013).
  EmptyState/ErrorDisplay → VehicleDetailEmptyContent / VehicleDetailErrorView (web null-data branches; no blank box).
